---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Podcast" active="podcast" description="Dam Kind Conversations. Humane perspectives from those with lived experience.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <h1>Dam Kind Conversations</h1>
    <p class="lede">Amsterdam based researcher, Ben Culpin, explores humane perspectives from those with lived experience.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="podcast-body">
    <p>I've produced many thought pieces over the years that feature people's perspectives and lived experience, however until now my process has been largely off-grid. I only share when something is complete. But that style gets lonely. This podcast is an effort to open up the process, lean into the vulnerability, and maintain thoughtful exploration with integrity.</p>
    <p class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/dam-kind-conversations/id1710105631" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Podcasts</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://spotify.link/WGGx9uoMADb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spotify</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@damkind_/featured" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a>
    </p>
    <p class="podcast-door"><a href="https://www.damkind.xyz/">The show lives at damkind.xyz</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
